  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to boil.\n• Cut brown onion and tomato into wedges. Slice zucchini into rounds. Cut capsicum into chunks.\n• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, spread out evenly and roast until tender, 15-20 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e78b6ffa7a20c3b9b8d/step-5ef21600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cook fusilli in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2P / 2/3 cup for 4P), then drain pasta. Drizzle with olive oil to prevent sticking and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e78b6ffa7a20c3b9b8d/step-b6cb8010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies are roasted, heat a large frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tomato paste until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the reserved pasta water, stock powder, basil pesto, Parmesan cheese and roasted veggies. Gently stir until warmed through, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e78b6ffa7a20c3b9b8d/step-399ce220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in cooked fusilli. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Divide pasta between bowls and top with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68870e78b6ffa7a20c3b9b8d/step-f0bb8830.jpg"
    }
  ]
